Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-161: laptop package 126's designer part merged
 into the machine tree -- ES02's 0.158-0.161 (0.161.0)

GitHub main 2efc840 (GitLab 8f3cdc53), mixed; its C++ / web part = the integration session's 7f05533 (cpp 0130).
Three-way on the package's base_283f8382 (= package 125), against the tree as it is now, CRLF to LF first: 9 files
changed only by ES02 copied byte for byte; CHANGELOG.md, extension.js, HANDOVER.md, test/smoke_extension.js on both
sides (git merge-file, no conflict). The machine's own patches kept: tools 0136 (Alias), 0143 (.claude skipped,
lint counted), 0145 (panelColumn, head-script forwarding pages, vscode_it design layout / 600 s).
ES02's 0.158: an Image's Picture can be changed (a path, or Choose -- copied into the page's img\ first); 0.159: the
Solution Explorer's frame to the bottom; 0.160: Group Into a Panel or a GroupBox (positions unchanged); 0.161: the
margin adorners on all four sides.
Tests: lib 179/179, probe 7/7 + tab tree 7/7, extension 221/221, panels all pass; real VS Code 156/159 (the 3 known
"Pages" list checks, out of date since 0.139); e2e_build.ps1 not run. Package 127 has no designer files.

